    <text><list><item>No medication changes [S]</item><item>Goal: Gain at least 10 ETDRS letters in the left eye by the end of the loading phase. Outcome by 2026-05-07: Left eye improved from 55 to 69 letters after three injections [S]</item><item>Goal: Dry macula on OCT (central subfield thickness below 300 um, no fluid) by the end of the loading phase. Outcome by 2026-05-07: Central subfield thickness fell from 418 to 274 um with no fluid [S]</item><item>Goal: Check the Amsler grid daily for each eye and report any change the same day. Outcome by 2026-07-02: Daily checks recorded; no new change in the right eye [S]</item><item>Goal: Complete a low-vision rehabilitation evaluation and set up studio lighting and magnification by the July visit. Outcome by 2026-07-02: Task lighting, a stand magnifier, and high-contrast labels in place; still painting daily [S]</item><item>Continue the care plan agreed on 2026-03-10 [S]</item><item>Next visit 2026-10-15: subsequent annual wellness visit [S]</item></list></text>

